# --- Corrections (a stray stress on the final "-ee", ruled 2026-11-04, #284) ---
#
# CMUdict marks the unstressed final "-ee" of these words IY2, as it did the -ity
# words above, so each had the bare Rhyme Key IY: `thirty` and `apology` scored for
# `tree` and were refused for `dirty` and `geology`. The maintainer ruled each word
# by ear on 2026-11-04: these are said with no beat at the end, so the final vowel
# is IY0 on every reading, and a playable inflection with the same mark
# (`companies`, `libraries`) gets its own line. Words ruled to keep a beat
# (`bumblebee`, `turnkey`, `apogee`) have no line here. A second upstream error in
# the same reading is corrected with it, because this entry replaces the reading:
# `antinomy` and `astilbe` had lost a consonant; `mixology`, `phenomenology` and
# `psychopathology` had G for JH; `peyote` had AO for OW and `tomography` OW for
# AA; `inquiry` had a reading with no stress and a doubled R; `actuary` carried
# two primary stresses; `library` had its secondary stress on the "-ee" instead of
# the "-rar-" (as `dictionary` has it); `maxillary` was stressed the British way;
# `predominately` was spelled out as `predominantly`; and `-oscopy` had OW0 where
# `microscopy` has AH0. A stray secondary stress earlier in the word went too
# (`imaginatively`, `indisputably`, `liberally`, `spiritually`, `staggeringly`,
# the second of `epidemiologically`'s). `realty` loses its "RILL-ih-tee"
# reading, a mispronunciation that would have scored it for `facility`.
# Built by `.scratch/284/lines.py`.
