#
# CMUdict holds each of these words twice, once with the t of "-ental" and once without
# (`gentle` said "jennle"). The t-dropped reading put the `incidental` family in `kennel`'s
# (2026-11-11). The maintainer ruled on 2026-11-02 that they do not rhyme with `kennel`
# (ADR-0011, 2026-11-02 amendment), so each word keeps only its readings with that t, and
# still rhymes with `incidental`. Normalisation still appends the reduced "-ntl" form. A t
# dropped elsewhere in the word (`sentimental` "sennimental") was kept, and went with #299.
# `interdental` and `nonjudgmental` are derived from `dental` and `judgmental`.
