# --- Corrections (a weak ending stress promotion stressed, ruled 2026-11-04, #298) ---
#
# CMUdict writes the endings of these words with a full vowel, unstressed, and stress
# promotion (ADR-0011, rule 3) gave that vowel a beat: `gutless` and `thankfulness`
# scored for `chess`, `comment` and `document` for `event`, `iceman` for `man`. The
# maintainer ruled 16 of 16 sampled words on `-less`, `-ness`, `-ment` and `-man/-men`
# wrong on 2026-11-04, and `yokel`, `prequel`, `template`, `darnedest` and `fortune`
# with them, so each word here is written with the schwa it is said with and promotion
# no longer reaches it. A reading CMUdict already holds weak is kept and the full one
# dropped (`announcement`, `marchioness`, `template`, `fortune`). Each word was checked,
# not ruled by suffix: `foment` (fo-MENT), `spiderman` (as `superman`) and `debell`
# (de-BELL) carry a beat on the ending and have no line. `compliment` follows its
# homophone `complement` and the ruled `document`, whose verb readings are weak here too.
# `quantifiable`, `trowel` and `viertel` share the `motel` key with `yokel` and were
# not ruled; their endings are plainly weak. A second upstream error in the same reading
# is fixed with it: `flavorless` had a beat on "-vor", `midshipmen` two primary
# stresses, and `trowel` is written as `towel` and `vowel` are. `fortunes` follows
# `fortune`. Generated by `.scratch/298/gen-lines.mjs`.
